				"id": "http://rcsailboats.micro.blog/2026/09/22/when-computers-were-exciting/",
				
				"content_html": "<p>When computers were exciting</p>\n<p><img src=\"uploads/2026/whole-earth-software-review-1984-3-june.png\" width=\"463\" height=\"600\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/whole-earth-software-review-1984-3-june-3.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"354\" alt=\"A list titled Whole Earth Recommended Organizing Tools (June 1984) categorizes various software and tools, including books, little boxes, bigger little boxes, garbage bags, and computer organizing programs, along with their prices and page references.\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/whole-earth-software-review-1984-3-june-2.png\" width=\"579\" height=\"600\" alt=\"The page features a vintage computer screen displaying the PFS:WRITE program with accompanying text and reviews highlighting its simplicity and advantages compared to other word processing software.\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/whole-earth-software-review-1984-3-june-4.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"328\" alt=\"Artificial intelligence is becoming a marketing buzzword with early expert systems mimicking human activities through rule-based approaches, and future advances expected from massively parallel processors and specialized languages.\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/7f6e205003.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"273\" alt=\"A categorized list from June 1984 recommends hardware tools ranging from easy buys like the Commodore 64 and Apple IIc to relatively difficult buys such as the Sanyo 5559 and DEC Rainbow.\"></p>\n",
				"content_text": "When computers were exciting \n\n<img src=\"uploads/2026/whole-earth-software-review-1984-3-june.png\" width=\"463\" height=\"600\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/whole-earth-software-review-1984-3-june-3.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"354\" alt=\"A list titled Whole Earth Recommended Organizing Tools (June 1984) categorizes various software and tools, including books, little boxes, bigger little boxes, garbage bags, and computer organizing programs, along with their prices and page references.\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/whole-earth-software-review-1984-3-june-2.png\" width=\"579\" height=\"600\" alt=\"The page features a vintage computer screen displaying the PFS:WRITE program with accompanying text and reviews highlighting its simplicity and advantages compared to other word processing software.\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/whole-earth-software-review-1984-3-june-4.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"328\" alt=\"Artificial intelligence is becoming a marketing buzzword with early expert systems mimicking human activities through rule-based approaches, and future advances expected from massively parallel processors and specialized languages.\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/7f6e205003.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"273\" alt=\"A categorized list from June 1984 recommends hardware tools ranging from easy buys like the Commodore 64 and Apple IIc to relatively difficult buys such as the Sanyo 5559 and DEC Rainbow.\">\n",
				"date_published": "2026-09-22T16:48:09-04:00",
				"url": "https://rcsail.boats/2026/09/22/when-computers-were-exciting/"
			},
